{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34106","headline":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平去声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 奉詶鲁望夏日四声四首 平去声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怡神时高吟，快意乍四顾。\n村深啼愁鹃，浪霁醒睡鹭。\n书疲行终朝，罩困卧至暮。\n吁嗟当今交，暂贵便异路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}